   "source": [
    "# Step 9: Model 2 – Bidirectional LSTM model (build and train)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "61559f1d-658a-4c31-bbc4-33f4b37e05b1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
